source_event:           pal 0.4.3 HarmonyOS PC 适配（构建机 B，CONAN_HOME=$HOME/tmp/ch/home-pal，readline/8.3）。首错
                        ~/tmp/uc2/z71-pal/explore/make.log:157「manage.c:406:26: error: use of undeclared identifier 'Function'」，
                        另一次复现 ~/tmp/uc2/z71-pal/explore-build2.log:70。按本条换公开类型后
                        ~/tmp/uc2/z71-pal/explore-smoke.log:10 记 MAKE_RC=0，修改固化为单行 hunk 补丁
                        archives/p/pal/0.4.3/patches/0002-manage.c-readline-public-hook-type.patch，
                        conan create 与 W3 本地 CI 通过（判决件 archives/p/pal/0.4.3/reports/）
